{"text": "MEMORANDUN\n\nSES\nen\n\nES\nTHE CITY OF KEY WEST\n\nPost Office Box 1409 Key West, FL 33041-1409 (305) 809-3700\n\nTo: Jim Scholl, City Manager\nFrom: John Wilkins, Parking Director\nRe: Rainbow Flag Crosswalk\nDear Jim,\nAs requested, I met with Key West Business Guild Executive Director, Matt Hon and\ndiscussed the Rainbow Crosswalk project. Based on their request, the attached design was\ncreated.\nQuotes were requested from 3 vendors for the required material. We received 2 complete\nquotes and one incomplete (purple and orange missing). The cost is expected to be\napproximately $5,000.00 for materials. Labor will be provided by Community Service.\n\nFunds have been identified from unused budgeted items for this expense if approved.\n\nIf you have any questions or comments, Please let me know.\n\nSincerely,\n\nKey to the Carib6ean \u2014 average yearly temperature 77 \u00b0 Fafirenhicit.",
